# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("`rebuild`": holds start over, places are new under `#g`, a generation is built at the end of the tick its dynamic changes and the old one leaves at the end of that tick; "What a `rebuild` hands back") and ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent; "The patch": a place that leaves at the end of n is removed in n).
test generations_give_a_named_bundle

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="next")
    1/#0/0: Ui.Button(label="more on 1")
    1/#0/1: Ui.Label(text="page 1: 1")

tick 1
  in:
    1/#0/0: click
  changed:
    1/#0/1: Ui.Label(text="page 1: 2")

tick 2
  in:
    0: click
  added:
    1/#1/0: Ui.Button(label="more on 2")
    1/#1/1: Ui.Label(text="page 2: 1")
  torn down:
    1/#0/0: Ui.Button(label="more on 1")
    1/#0/1: Ui.Label(text="page 1: 2")
